Agentic RL Lab · Local GPU Edition

This repository is a modified version of Datawhale Agentic RL Lab
(https://github.com/datawhalechina/agentic-rl-lab), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Original tutorial content, experiment code and
figures are by KMnO4-zx and the Agentic RL Lab contributors (including MRLE
for Tournament-GRPO).

Modifications in this repository:
- Added `localtrio/`, a local implementation of the PyTRIO-style training and
  sampling API built on Hugging Face transformers, PEFT and vLLM.
- Replaced `import pytrio as trio` with `import localtrio as trio` in the
  experiment code and adapted cloud-specific code paths (remote checkpoint
  paths, the PyTRIO OpenAI-compatible endpoint, login and billing notes).
- Rewrote the chapter documentation and the website for running on local GPUs
  (4x NVIDIA RTX A6000), added GPU layout presets, tests and guides.

Experiment results and figures reproduced from the original tutorial were
obtained by the original authors on the PyTRIO service.
